  description:
  - After running out of stamina, you will faint, dropping half of your held Mints.
    If you faint during the night, you will re-awaken at dawn, with the chance of
    some structures on your farm potentially destroyed during your time away.
  leftText: 
  rightText: After running out of stamina, you will faint, dropping some of your
    held Mints. If you faint during the night, you will re-awaken at dawn, with the
    chance of some structures on your farm potentially destroyed during your time
    away.
